SENTIMENT DICTIONARY

The Chinese Financial Sentiment Dictionary is based on:
- Loughran & McDonald (2011) financial sentiment dictionary
- Extensions by Jiang Fuwei Team (2016)

Academic use is permitted. Please cite original sources in publications.

